age":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Recommender System is a system that seeks to predict or filter preferences according to the user\u2019s choices. Recommender systems are utilized in a variety of areas including movies, music, news, books, research articles, search queries, social tags, and products in general.The main goal of this machine learning project is to build a recommendation engine that recommends movies to users.","topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251456},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Wine-Quality-Prediction","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Wine-Quality-Prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"It\u2019s a known fact that older the wine, better the taste. However, there are several factors other than age that go into wine quality certification which include physiochemical tests like alcohol quantity, fixed acidity, volatile acidity, determination of density, pH and more. The main goal of this machine learning project is to build a machine learning model to predict the quality of wines by exploring their various chemical properties. Wine quality dataset consists of 4898 observations with 11 independent and 1 dependent variable.","topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251457},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Housing-Price-Prediction","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Housing-Price-Prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"House prices increase every year, so there is a need for a system to predict house prices in the future. House price prediction can help the developer determine the selling price of a house and can help the customer to arrange the right time to purchase a house. There are three factors that influence the price of a house which include physical conditions, concept and location. This project aims to predict house prices. Proudly created by Harsh Nagoriya","topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251458},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The aim of this project is to classify iris flowers among three species (setosa, versicolor or virginica) from measurements of length and width of sepals and petals.","topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251459},{"name":"Trogluddite/trogluddite.github.io","owner":"Trogluddite","html_url":"https://github.com/Trogluddite/trogluddite.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251460},{"name":"AnanthaR20/CensusApp","owner":"AnanthaR20","html_url":"https://github.com/AnanthaR20/CensusApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251461},{"name":"AnanthaR20/COVID-19-Analysis","owner":"AnanthaR20","html_url":"https://github.com/AnanthaR20/COVID-19-Analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":["covid-19","summary-graph"],"score":2163,"global_rank":251462},{"name":"bryan-md/debate-analysis","owner":"bryan-md","html_url":"https://github.com/bryan-md/debate-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Analysis of 2020 Democratic Debates","topics":["data-analysis","data-manipulation","data-visualization","matplotlib","pandas","tableau"],"score":2163,"global_rank":251465},{"name":"rkamradt/HelloK8sBuild","owner":"rkamradt","html_url":"https://github.com/rkamradt/HelloK8sBuild","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Groovy","description":"Build pipeline for the HelloK8s project","topics":[],"score":2163,"global_rank":251466},{"name":"commiewalker/codeRefactor","owner":"commiewalker","html_url":"https://github.com/commiewalker/codeRefactor","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"scor